# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local `wrangler dev`. Never commit `.dev.vars`.
#
# Bootstrap only — Mailgun/SMTP, site URL, crypto keys for sessions/OTP/actions,
# and the first admin are configured in the setup wizard (stored encrypted in
# `app_settings`, sealed by INSTANCE_SECRET).
#
# Production: `wrangler secret put INSTANCE_SECRET` and
# `wrangler secret put SETUP_TOKEN` (SETUP_TOKEN can be removed after setup).

INSTANCE_SECRET=generate-with-openssl-rand-hex-32
SETUP_TOKEN=change-me-before-first-setup
